WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.177
Two models, one input. Right now, they agree.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.631
Now we rotate the whole input.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.593
The left keeps up. The right drifts, in orange.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.170
Only the left model turns with the input.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.696
Rotate, then predict, equals predict, then rotate.
